cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "causalbase: causal structure learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Torrijos"
    given-names: "Pablo"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Castilla-La Mancha"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ptorrijos99/causalbase"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A Python library for causal structure learning from data held in one place:
  greedy equivalence search (GES) and XGES over BDeu, BIC or Gaussian BIC,
  with compiled scores, graph kernels, metrics, XMLBIF input and output, and
  bundled benchmark networks. The federated methods of fedcausal build on it.
keywords:
  - causal discovery
  - structure learning
  - Bayesian networks
  - greedy equivalence search
  - BDeu

references:
  - type: article
    title: "Optimal structure identification with greedy search"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Chickering"
        given-names: "David Maxwell"
    journal: "Journal of Machine Learning Research"
    volume: 3
    year: 2002
    start: 507
    end: 554
